/*!
\mainpage OCUDU dApp SDK

The OCUDU dApp SDK is a standalone repository of reference modules, process
workers, scaffolds, and certifiers. It consumes the installed \c OCUDUDAppSDK
CMake package and does not require the OCUDU source tree.

Working contracts remain package and ABI schema \b v1 until a formal release
decision.

\section sdk_doc_map Documentation map

| Page | Topic |
|------|-------|
| \ref sdk_quickstart | End-to-end author and operator walkthrough |
| \ref sdk_reference_packages | Shipped reference artifacts |
| \ref sdk_tools | Scaffold, certifier, and host tools |
| \ref sdk_class_a_cuda | Resident Class-A CUDA authoring |
| \ref sdk_class_b | Class-B scheduler authoring |
| \ref sdk_class_c_cuda | Class-C native and process authoring |
| \ref sdk_observer_authority | Spectrum observer vs authority |

Enable/run cookbooks for every example package (YAML + E3 + UUIDs) live in
Markdown \c docs/run_examples.md (preferred on GitHub/GitLab).

Git-rendered Markdown companions live in the parent \c docs/ directory and are
the preferred view on GitHub/GitLab. These Doxygen pages match the main OCUDU
repository documentation style for HTML builds.

\section sdk_build Build this documentation

\code{.sh}
cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_PREFIX_PATH=/path/to/installed/ocudu-dapp-sdk
cmake --build build --target doxygen
\endcode

Open \c build/docs/doxygen/html/index.html.

\section sdk_host_docs OCUDU host documentation

Runtime, catalog, and E3 guides ship with the OCUDU tree:

- \c docs/dapp/README.md — Git index
- \c docs/dapp/e3_management.md, \c e3_wire.md, \c e3_system_design.md
- \c docs/doxygen/dapp_*.dox and \c e3_*.dox

*/
